# 9. Event Schema

All events must include the **canonical envelope** (event_id, event_type, timestamp, source, version). Full field definitions and evolution rules: **event_schema.mdc**.

Example `VoteRevealed` event (envelope + payload; tally source):

```json
{
  "event_id": "uuid",
  "event_type": "VoteRevealed",
  "timestamp": 1700000000,
  "source": "voting-contract",
  "version": 1,
  "proposal_id": "string",
  "option_id": "string",
  "voter_pubkey": "string",
  "slot": 100234,
  "tx_signature": "string"
}
```

`VoteCommitted` carries `commitment` hash only (no `option_id`). Solana uses **slot**; do not use block_number. Full schema: **event_schema.mdc**.

