# 11. Observability

Observability is a core requirement.

Grafana should provide cross-cloud dashboards.

Datasources:
- AWS CloudWatch
- GCP Monitoring
- BigQuery

Key metrics:
- vote throughput
- end-to-end latency
- SQS queue depth
- DLQ events
- error rate
- active voters

Code implications: prefer structured logs, include correlation fields (event_id, proposal_id, service) to trace events end-to-end, expose basic metrics where feasible (CloudWatch / GCP Monitoring), and ensure failures are visible (log + metrics + DLQ where applicable).

---

# 12. Idempotency Requirements

Because SQS provides at-least-once delivery, services must be idempotent.

Strategies include:
- event deduplication
- transaction id tracking
- upsert operations

No service may assume exactly-once delivery.

